        "## 7. Adaptive Strategy Backtest\n",
        "\n",
        "The strategy begins with the full portfolio value held in cash.\n",
        "\n",
        "On each execution date:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Existing portfolio weights are calculated.\n",
        "2. The portfolio is rebalanced to the new target weights.\n",
        "3. Transaction costs are deducted based on portfolio turnover.\n",
        "4. Equity and cash returns are applied.\n",
        "5. Portfolio value and actual weights are recorded.\n",
        "\n",
        "The current transaction-cost and cash-return assumptions are provisional and will be refined later."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "6gmAL1jkYMnL"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Daily cash return based on the provisional annual risk-free rate\n",
        "\n",
        "daily_cash_return = (\n",
        "    (1 + RISK_FREE_RATE) ** (1 / TRADING_DAYS) - 1\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "# Daily stock returns for the backtest\n",
        "backtest_stock_returns = (\n",
        "    stock_prices\n",
        "    .pct_change()\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Backtest assumptions\")\n",
        "print(\"-\" * 40)\n",
        "print(f\"Initial capital: ₹{INITIAL_CAPITAL:,.0f}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Transaction-cost rate: {TRANSACTION_COST_RATE:.2%}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Annual cash-return assumption: {RISK_FREE_RATE:.2%}\")"
      ],
